        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2013 Conference USA men's soccer season\n- Organizations: Conference USA, American Athletic Conference, NCAA\n- Teams: Tulsa Golden Hurricane\n- Concepts: NCAA Division I, Football Bowl Subdivision\n\nFacts:\n- The 2013 Conference USA men's soccer season was set to be the 19th season of men's varsity soccer in Conference USA.\n- The 2013 Conference USA men's soccer season was set to be the last Conference USA men's soccer season for the Tulsa Golden Hurricane.\n- The Tulsa Golden Hurricane was scheduled to join the American Athletic Conference in July 2014.\n- The American Athletic Conference is an American collegiate athletic conference also known as The American and abbreviated AAC.\n- The American Athletic Conference includes 12 member universities and three associate member universities.\n- The American Athletic Conference competes in the NCAA's Division I, and its football teams compete in the Football Bowl Subdivision.",
